id":"archive-781","post_id":"781","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104242980739381","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-27","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/781/","text":"Today we're celebrating Alex Schultz's 10 year anniversary of joining Facebook. Alex is one of a small handful of people that I can say without his work, our community would not have connected more...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104242980739381","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-780","post_id":"780","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104242660091961","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-27","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/780/","text":"Here's a good use of AI: helping prevent suicide.\n\nStarting today we're upgrading our AI tools to identify when someone is expressing thoughts about suicide on Facebook so we can help get them the...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104242660091961","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-996","post_id":"996","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/notes/mark-zuckerberg/wrapping-up-a-year-of-travel/10155448869996634/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/996/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-779","post_id":"779","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104190162732091","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/779/","text":"On my first date with Priscilla (14 years ago today!!), she told me about an after school program she was volunteering at in a low income housing development through the Philips Brooks House...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104190162732091","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-778","post_id":"778","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104183418587411","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/778/","text":"It was an honor to thank this group of veterans in person on the last stop of my Year of Travel. Thank you to all who have served.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104183418587411","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-995","post_id":"995","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10104181411255121","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/995/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-777","post_id":"777","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104177999317671","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/777/","text":"I'm in St. Louis, Missouri meeting with small business owners as part of my last trip of the Year of Travel.\n \nI've visited a lot of communities this year and one theme I've found is that strong...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104177999317671","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-776","post_id":"776","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104174467739981","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-08","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/776/","text":"I'm in Oklahoma on the last trip of my Year of Travel challenge. I've got a few more stops and then Friday morning I'm doing a live discussion in Kansas about what I've learned this year. \n\nIn...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104174467739981","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-775","post_id":"775","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104174814021031","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-08","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/775/","text":"Inspired by the Dreamers I met in Oklahoma City. A good reminder that we need to pass the Dream Act before the end of this year.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104174814021031","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-646","post_id":"646","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104148941579611","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-02","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/646/","text":"It's an honor to host Taoiseach Leo Varadkar T.D. at Facebook. It's inspiring to meet a new generation of world leaders recently elected as heads of state in countries around the world.\n\nIreland is...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104148941579611","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-645","post_id":"645","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104146268321841","published_at":null,"published_date":"2017-11-01","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/645/","text":"We just announced our quarterly results and community update. The most important thing I discussed was the work we're doing to protect the security and integrity of our service. We're investing so...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104146268321841","text_truncated":false}]